{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026KVtxxOStwE1793195904.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>勞工處指，過去三年接獲93宗與熱壓力有關的工傷個案，會調整突擊巡查力度。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.L.HOT-1600_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026jY5ag1uatd1793195912.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>勞工及福利局局長孫玉菡回覆議員書面質詢指，當中65宗已由僱主支付補償，僱員撤銷或不再繼續索償的有共17宗。勞工處會持續檢視，預防工作時中暑相關機制的運作情況，有需要時作優化。</p><p></p><p>又指過去三年夏季，處方分別進行了逾兩萬次有關熱壓力風險控制措施的突擊巡查，發出逾2,700封警告信，隨著氣候變化，預計將出現更多熱壓力情況，處方會相應調整突擊巡查力度，及檢視有否需要調適執法門檻。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:01:23.231058+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":223,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T11:18:14.444655+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T14:58:26.175506+00:00","content_hash":"4064e1381a1503050ec2a20ec08cde87bab5e194e8ec94d93f775f6bc5515adc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:01:23.231058+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}